site_name: Vishal Kasaudhan – API Documentation Portfolio
site_description: Technical Writer specializing in API documentation, REST APIs, and developer guides.
site_author: Vishal Kasaudhan
site_url: https://vishal160703.github.io/api-documentation-portfolio/

repo_name: Vishal160703/api-documentation-portfolio
repo_url: https://github.com/Vishal160703/api-documentation-portfolio

theme:
  name: material
  palette:
    - scheme: default
      primary: indigo
      accent: indigo
      toggle:
        icon: material/brightness-7
        name: Switch to dark mode
    - scheme: slate
      primary: indigo
      accent: indigo
      toggle:
        icon: material/brightness-4
        name: Switch to light mode
  font:
    text: Inter
    code: JetBrains Mono
  features:
    - navigation.tabs
    - navigation.sections
    - navigation.top
    - search.suggest
    - search.highlight
    - content.code.copy
    - content.code.annotate

plugins:
  - search

markdown_extensions:
  - admonition
  - pymdownx.details
  - pymdownx.superfences
  - pymdownx.highlight:
      anchor_linenums: true
  - pymdownx.tabbed:
      alternate_style: true
  - tables
  - attr_list

nav:
  - Home: index.md
  - Posts API:
    - Overview: posts-api/overview.md
    - GET Posts: posts-api/get-posts.md
    - POST Create Post: posts-api/post-create.md
    - Error Reference: posts-api/errors.md
  - Users API:
    - Overview: users-api/overview.md
    - POST Create User: users-api/post-create-user.md
  - Guides:
    - Authentication: guides/authentication.md
    - Use Case Workflow: guides/use-case.md
  - About: about.md

# API Documentation Portfolio 📚

A structured API documentation portfolio built with **MkDocs Material**, showcasing REST API documentation skills.

🌐 **Live site:** https://vishal160703.github.io/api-documentation-portfolio/

---

## What's Documented

- **Posts API** — GET and POST endpoints with full request/response examples
- **Users API** — User creation endpoint
- **Authentication Guide** — Bearer Token auth explained
- **Use Case Workflow** — End-to-end chained API calls

---

## Tech Stack

| Tool | Purpose |
|---|---|
| MkDocs Material | Documentation site generator |
| Markdown | Content authoring |
| GitHub Actions | Auto-deploy on push |
| GitHub Pages | Hosting |
| Postman | API testing & validation |

---

## Run Locally

```bash
pip install mkdocs-material
mkdocs serve
```

Then open `http://127.0.0.1:8000` in your browser.

